# Daily Hacker News crawl -> draft Subjects for the CMS review queue at
# /dashboard/subjects/?status=draft. Run by the `cron` compose service via supercronic.
#
# Wall clock is the container TZ (compose sets TZ=Asia/Jakarta), matching settings.TIME_ZONE.
# supercronic timestamps and forwards job output to its own stdout, so `docker compose logs
# cron` is the log — no redirect needed here.
0 8 * * * cd /app && uv run manage.py crawl_hn
